 {"id":"6.32","q":"Which of the following is studied under 'performance' in SCP analysis?","o":["Return on equity and return on invested capital","Number of players in the industry","Whether the business is seasonal","Threat from substitute products"],"a":0,"w":"Performance covers RoE, RoIC, WACC. The others are structure or conduct."},
