 {"id":"6.43","q":"A company's taxable profit is Rs 100 crore, taxed at 30%. Income is above Rs 10 crore. Using the book's surcharge and cess rates, total tax is about:","o":["Rs 34.94 crore","Rs 30 crore","Rs 33.60 crore","Rs 46 crore"],"a":0,"w":"Tax 30; surcharge 12% of 30 = 3.6; cess 4% of 33.6 = 1.344. Total 34.944."},
